&lt;p&gt;Claude skills enable teams to refine instructions as requirements change, while strategy, factual validation, and business decisions remain under human control. This guide explains which Claude skills are most useful for marketing and sales teams, how to build practical examples, and when authorized HubSpot context can make the work more relevant.&lt;/p&gt; 
