&lt;a&gt;&lt;/a&gt; 
&lt;h2&gt;What is a transactional email?&lt;/h2&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;A &lt;a href="https://blog.hubspot.com/marketing/what-is-a-transactional-email-ht"&gt;transactional email&lt;/a&gt; is a one-to-one operational message triggered by a specific user action or system event. Some examples of transactional emails are:&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;ul&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;Password reset emails&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;Order confirmations&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;Payment-failure notices&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;Suspicious-login alerts&lt;/li&gt; 
&lt;/ul&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;The email system sends each transactional message to one recipient because something relevant happened to that person or account. “One-to-one” describes that event-to-recipient relationship; however, emails can still be generated automatically at scale.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;Transactional emails shouldn’t be confused with bulk emails, where the sender chooses a segment and distributes substantially similar content according to a campaign schedule.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;a&gt;&lt;/a&gt; 
&lt;h2&gt;Transactional Email vs. Marketing Email: What’s the Difference?&lt;/h2&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Marketing email&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; creates demand or prompts a new commercial action. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;Transactional email &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;helps users complete, confirm, or monitor an interaction already underway.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.hubspot.com/marketing/how-to-personalize-transactional-emails-with-dynamic-content"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space-collapse: preserve;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;Automation and personalization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt; can apply to both. However, the sending infrastructure for marketing and transactional emails has to be separated.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;A marketing campaign can cause volume spikes, complaints, or bounces. Shared infrastructure between marketing and transactional email can let those problems linger or filter password resets, receipts, and account alerts. For this reason, it’s not uncommon for large email sender platforms like Yahoo to recommend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="https://senders.yahooinc.com/best-practices/"&gt;&lt;span style="white-space-collapse: preserve;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;separating marketing and transactional traffic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt; by IP address or DKIM domain.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Separation also protects customer trust. A marketing opt-out can stop promotions without suppressing essential transactional notifications. Customers also learn that operational emails will lead with the information they need, rather than hide it beneath a sales pitch.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Featured resource:&lt;span style="white-space-collapse: preserve;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.hubspot.com/customers/difference-between-transactional-and-marketing-email"&gt;&lt;u&gt;The Difference Between Marketing Email and Transactional Email&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;a&gt;&lt;/a&gt; 
&lt;h2&gt;Transactional Email Examples Across the Customer Journey&lt;/h2&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;The strongest &lt;a href="https://blog.hubspot.com/marketing/transactional-email-campaigns-examples"&gt;transactional email examples&lt;/a&gt; solve one immediate customer need. They confirm access, document a payment, report progress, or surface relevant account activity. Let’s walk through real-world examples of transactional emails at each stage of the customer lifecycle, organized by type.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;h3&gt;Account and Security Notifications&lt;/h3&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;Account and security emails protect access from signup onward. Common examples include password resets, login alerts, and two-factor authentication codes. Each message should identify the event, explain the next step, and state when a link or code expires. Login alerts should also show the device, time, or approximate location. That context helps users separate a legitimate warning from phishing.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;For example, HubSpot nudges all their users to protect their accounts with two-...

&lt;p&gt;AI Overviews have shifted how audiences discover brands. Gone are the days when users would click through multiple search results until they found what they’re looking for. Now, &lt;a href="https://blog.hubspot.com/marketing/ai-overviews"&gt;AI Overviews&lt;/a&gt; answers questions directly on the results page, meaning brands are either cited or ignored without users ever visiting a website.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: transparent;"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: transparent;"&gt;&lt;a class="cta_button" href="https://www.hubspot.com/cs/ci/?pg=07ca2318-c9e0-4b5d-bcba-95cec5cb4958&amp;amp;pid=53&amp;amp;ecid=&amp;amp;hseid=&amp;amp;hsic="&gt;&lt;img class="hs-cta-img " style="height: auto !important; width: auto !important; max-width: 100% !important;border-width: 0px; /*hs-extra-styles*/; margin: 0 auto; display: block; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px" alt="Download Now: The State of AEO in 2026 [Free AI Search Trends Report]" height="79" width="369" src="https://no-cache.hubspot.com/cta/default/53/07ca2318-c9e0-4b5d-bcba-95cec5cb4958.png" align="middle"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: transparent;"&gt;The changes brought on by AI Overviews mean marketers need to adjust the way they track brand visibility. Here’s what you need to know about tracking AI Overviews and what data actually shows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Table of Contents&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;ul&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#why-tracking-ai-overviews-matters-now"&gt;Why Tracking AI Overviews Matters Now&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#how-tracking-ai-overviews-works-from-baseline-to-benchmarks"&gt;How Tracking AI Overviews Works From Baseline To Benchmarks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#tracking-ai-overviews-across-new-keywords-and-topics"&gt;Tracking AI Overviews Across New Keywords And Topics&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#how-do-i-find-ai-overviews-in-search-for-my-topics"&gt;How Do I Find AI Overviews In Search For My Topics?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#tracking-ai-overviews-with-visibility-and-citation-kpis"&gt;Tracking AI Overviews With Visibility And Citation KPIs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; 
